{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-fibre-functor-atlas","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:fibre-functor-atlas","kind":"proposition","title":"Fibre functors as an affine atlas with $G$-torsor transitions","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-contact-affine-chart","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-tannaka-krein-overview"],"tags":["fibre-functor","affine-chart","atlas","tannaka-krein","G-torsor","cocycle"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.fibre_functor_atlas","text":"fibre-functor-atlas.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:fibre-functor-atlas\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe with gauge group <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G</code>. For any two fibre functors <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau', \\tau'' \\colon \\mathbf{C} \\to R\\text{-}\\mathbf{Mod}</code>, the space of monoidal natural isomorphisms <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau' \\Rightarrow \\tau''</code> forms a <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G</code>-torsor, and functorial composition enforces the cocycle condition. Hence the category of all fibre functors of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> forms a <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G</code>-gerbe.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fibre-functor-atlas.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"4.6.1","page":"b/prop-fibre-functor-atlas","qa":{"counts":{"pass":89,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":76},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.fibre_functor_atlas","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Core/fibre_functor_atlas.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
